title: Tidbits: Intro
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki


Tidbits is a recipe wiki — a TiddlyWiki edition tuned for storing, browsing, and cooking from your own recipes.  If TiddlyWiki itself is new to you, the [[main TiddlyWiki documentation|https://tiddlywiki.com/]] covers the basics of [[tiddlers|https://tiddlywiki.com/#Tiddlers]], [[tags|https://tiddlywiki.com/#Tagging]], and [[fields|https://tiddlywiki.com/#TiddlerFields]].  This page describes only what's specific to the recipe edition.
